    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Experience a Different Typing Experience</strong></i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>WildType</i></strong> is a text editor that turns boring daily typing into a visual enjoyment. When you type, various dynamic effects will bloom on the screen, bringing a unique <strong>&quot;wild&quot;</strong> style to your work or creative process. Say goodbye to monotony and make every tapping dynamic. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Improve your typing skills</strong></i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to being a typing tool for daily use, <i><strong>WildType</strong></i> also provides a dedicated <strong>&quot;speed mode&quot;</strong> and <strong>&quot;practice mode&quot;</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the built-in practice content, you can systematically train your fingering and gradually improve your typing speed and accuracy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Current core features:</strong></i> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time visual effect feedback </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports daily text input </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed \u200b\u200bmode provides real-time speed feedback </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basic typing practice mode </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vim-like motions to improve input movements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built-in Chinese pinyin input method</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope that <i><strong>WildType</strong></i> can be an interesting companion for your work and typing practice!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Experience a Different Typing Experience</strong></i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>WildType</i></strong> is a text editor that turns boring daily typing into a visual enjoyment. When you type, various dynamic effects will bloom on the screen, bringing a unique <strong>&quot;wild&quot;</strong> style to your work or creative process. Say goodbye to monotony and make every tapping dynamic. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Improve your typing skills</strong></i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to being a typing tool for daily use, <i><strong>WildType</strong></i> also provides a dedicated <strong>&quot;speed mode&quot;</strong> and <strong>&quot;practice mode&quot;</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the built-in practice content, you can systematically train your fingering and gradually improve your typing speed and accuracy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Current core features:</strong></i> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time visual effect feedback </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports daily text input </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed \u200b\u200bmode provides real-time speed feedback </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basic typing practice mode </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vim-like motions to improve input movements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built-in Chinese pinyin input method</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope that <i><strong>WildType</strong></i> can be an interesting companion for your work and typing practice!</p>",
    "short_description": "WildType is a daily typing and practice text editor that incorporates visual effects. When you enter text, dynamic effects will add a touch of &quot;wild&quot; fun to the typing process. The software has built-in practice mode and speed mode to help you effectively improve your typing speed.",
